{"title": "Ptarian Pacifism (Condition)", "pageid": 45208, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ptarian_Pacifism_(Condition)", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action Ptarian Dogma Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp\"